      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can tell that they were trying to copy the way you would do gestures on the Oculus/Meta touch controllers but didn't execute it well. There are people that just use Vive controllers for its touchpad wheel way of gestures, and doing Idle or Rock & Roll on the controllers in the beta wants you to hold your trigger mid way which is somewhat strange.\n\nIt's confusing, it is a good idea and other games like Half-Life: Alyx and Pavlov do it but you can't do it when people still use Vive controllers on your game for it's unique way of gestures for avatars. They should fix the beta gestures and give us the option to switch between the beta, original, or advanced original controls.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
